| Test: the 8-bit and 10-bit HEVC clips (all but 4K: see UHD) through the Pi 4's HEVC block (hevcdec), every
| picture checked against FFmpeg's own decode. Reports to Result.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 32768K -max 32768K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.Result
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.slices.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.nowpp.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.small10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.slices10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.crop10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd10.trace
